/* My Ihsan 0.6.50–0.6.52 (owner): Kewangan › Niaga › 📅 Tempahan / Bookings (in the app, works offline).
   Units: "night" (homestay rooms, whole homestay), "day" (hall, car, full-day photography) or "slot" (time slots), capacity, deposit.
   0.6.52 adds, from the owner's list:
   - Prices: normal → day-of-week (e.g. Fri/Sat nights) → school holiday → public holiday (the app's own calendars, by state) → own
     special dates (fixed price or +%), shown night by night. Packages (2D1N…: fixed price, nights, allowed check-in days, inclusions).
   - 🏡 Whole homestay unit: booking it blocks every room, a booked room blocks it; rule "Saturday nights / holidays: whole place
     only"; minimum nights by check-in day. The Homestay template asks how many rooms.
   - Add-ons (PA system, projector, BBQ, breakfast…): per booking / night / person / person per night, stock (never rented twice on
     the same dates), also saved in Niaga › Items. Discounts: RM or % per booking + automatic rules (long stay, weekdays only, early
     bird, returning customer); the staff discount limit of the profile still applies.
   - Money: every payment makes an official receipt (OR) against the booking's invoice (made and numbered on the first payment), so
     it counts as Collected at once; the balance later makes the invoice paid. Price changes after that add a debit / credit note.
   - Refunds: cancellation policy (days before → % back, deposit refundable or not), a suggested refund (editable, partial), a
     credit note for what is not charged, the refund recorded (method, date, reference, proof) and taken off Collected, or kept as
     customer credit for a later booking (used as a "credit" receipt that is not counted as new money). WhatsApp message.
   - Customers: search, recent and frequent at the top; group booking (several rooms, same dates, one customer, one invoice).
   - Codes: settable format prefix + date part + running number + suffix for bookings (BK-2611-014) and customers (C-2611-001).
   - Bulk edit: tick several units or add-ons, change price / weekend price / deposit / capacity / stock at once.
   Data: ihsan_biz.book[pid] = {units, bk, set}. NiagaBook.view(el, X)  X = niaga.js helpers. */
